'''8-Bit Rainbow''' was a [[Default Knife]] skin made by [[didi1147]]. It was designed in 2018 and is yet to be released.
==Appearance==
The knife has a colorful design. It has a pixelated-rainbow type appearance and a pair of deal with it glasses on the blade. It has a black handle.

==Trivia==
*This knife was leaked in one of JD's "Watch Me Work" videos. 
**Link to the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VORUY0AoOVg&list=PLQa3KDyrjPjLu7xBtnPQ2pGljPLb4JgNY&index=2&t=1011s video].
*This knife is similar to the older version of [[Shiny]] that was in the [[MLG Box|Chroma Box]]. The knife also had the MLG glasses and a rainbow type color similar to the original Rainbow knife texture.

